# Catalogue-only photos and right-side page tags

Status: DONE - catalogue and slower physical-turn follow-up published
Milestone: M57 Direct-photo catalogue and attached right-side arrow navigation
Dependencies: 52_LARGER_TITLES_OPAQUE_NOTEBOOK_TABS.todo, 61_BACK_CATEGORY_LABEL.todo

## Purpose

Remove per-photo Enlarge/Ask/Order controls. Open the existing photo viewer from
the cake image itself. Put both previous/next arrow tags on the book's right edge.
The later "remove the page turn button" request removes only a separate Turn
control/label/handle, not the requested previous/next arrows.

