## Acceptance criteria

- No per-photo action buttons, pseudo-labels or contact links in notebooks.
- Cake image links remain native without JavaScript; plain click/Enter/Space
  opens the existing viewer with exact full-photo URL and opener focus return.
- Modified/middle clicks retain native image-link behavior.
- Both opaque arrow tags attach16px/expose96px on the right, never left/bottom.
- No standalone Turn/page-turn button, label or extra drag handle. Optional upward
  dragging belongs to the Next arrow itself; keep both previous/next arrows.
- Four photos per full page, honest final page, normal2x2/short-landscape4x1.
- Preserve28px centered names,34px open titles,36px covers,24px description,
  48px targets, shared weights and main How to order/contact.
- No double advancement from the shared next/drag control; short/downward/
  cancelled gestures do not turn. All existing loading/error/static cases remain.
- No image viewing, archive import, Instagram posting, cream integration or edits
  to experiments\cream-metaballs or .agent-context.

